            <ArticleTitle>[Cystolysis. Supratrigonal denervation].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>773-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>CI is an entity with obscure etiopathogenesis and difficult to manage. This essay contributes three cases, out of a series of 25, were cytolisis was performed. Results after six months follow-up are very encouraging, since pain has disappeared in all cases and pollakiuria has been radically reduced.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
